# Build-context hygiene (WP16 — Node 20 → 24 migration).
# The frontend stage runs a fresh `npm ci`; host-local dev artifacts must not
# be shipped into the build context (a host node_modules copy carries
# host-arch native binaries and would overlay the stage-1 npm ci output).
**/node_modules
frontend/dist
venv
.venv
.env
.env.*
.git
.hermes
**/*.db
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
AGENTS.md
agent_review.md
local-import/
data/backups/
REVIEW_FINDINGS.md
